# Build context is the monorepo root. Keep it lean: everything the Dockerfile
# needs is COPYed explicitly (package manifests, layers/, apps/<APP>/).
**/node_modules
**/.output
**/.nuxt
**/dist
.git
.gitignore
**/.env
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/*.md
**/coverage
.worktrees
.claude
.idea
.vscode
**/.DS_Store
